{"resourceIdentifier":"2499","resourceName":"Guangzhou Huadu Shiling LFG Power Generation Project","description":"Guangzhou Huadu Shiling LFG Power Generation Project (hereinafter referred to as the Project) is located at Shiling landfill site in Huadu district, Guangzhou city, Guangdong province, P.R China. The purpose of the project is to utilize landfill gas (LFG), which consists mainly of methane, for electricity generation. It includes LFG collection system, LFG pre-treatment system and electricity generation system. LFG collected will be used for electricity generation with internal combustion generators. The total installed capacity of the project will be 4.268 MW (4*1.067MW), which started construction on 20-May-2019 and operated on 09-Jan-2020. \r\nIn absence of the project, equivalent amount of electricity exported to the grid by the project would have otherwise been supplied by South China Power Grid (SCPG). Greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions will be reduced by avoiding CO2 emissions from those fossil fuel-based power plants connected to the grid and by avoiding GHG emissions from releasing LFG into atmosphere at the landfill site.","location":{"latitude":23.491928,"longitude":113.098179},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2021-05-12","endExclusive":"2021-06-12","endInclusive":"2021-06-11"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2499"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Guangdong Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Guangzhou Zhongshui Recycling Environmental Protection Technology Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Guangdong, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2499"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"29193"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0001"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"06/08/2021"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 09/01/2020 - 08/01/2030"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=51996&IDKEY=a0e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla9a71702484","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"01-Huadu_VCS PD_V01.pdf","uploadDate":"2021-04-13T07:54:59.837Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=51998&IDKEY=i8723kjnf7kjandsaslmdv09887vaksmrmnwqkjoiuanfnfuq0771705242","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"03-Huadu_VCS-Listing-Representation-Single-Representor-v4.1.pdf","uploadDate":"2021-04-13T07:57:30.677Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=53244&IDKEY=nlksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku098f73423476","documentType":"Registration Representation","documentName":"05-Huadu_VCS-Registration-Representation-Single-Representor-v4.1.pdf","uploadDate":"2021-06-17T07:01:57.92Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=53246&IDKEY=n0e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla9373426234","documentType":"Validation Representation","documentName":"07-Huadu_VCS-Validation-Representation-v4.1.pdf","uploadDate":"2021-06-17T07:02:51.737Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_ISSUANCE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Issuance Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/m